Description: font manager for the COSMIC desktop
 Fonts browses the fonts installed on the system grouped by family,
 previews any variant in a size waterfall, opens a downloaded font file
 and installs it with one click, removes user-installed fonts, and pulls
 new families from the Google Fonts catalog.
 .
 Installs go to the user's font directory only; system fonts stay under
 the control of the package manager. Every install is verified after
 copying and duplicates are detected by the font's identity, not its
 file name.
 .
 Warning: the catalog is downloaded over HTTPS with rustls and the pure-Rust
 RustCrypto provider, which has not been audited. The app sends no
 credential and checks every downloaded font like a local file.
